  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"> <strong>تنزيل سورة يس مكتوبة كاملة </strong> pdf</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image is-style-default\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"536\" src=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Designer-1024x536.png\" alt=\"تنزيل سورة يس مكتوبة \" class=\"wp-image-6470\" style=\"width:461px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Designer-1024x536.png 1024w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Designer-300x157.png 300w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Designer-768x402.png 768w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Designer.png 1200w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:41px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">الحمد لله رب العالمين والصلاة والسلام على سيدنا محمد وعلى آله وصحبه أجمعين. أما بعد: يسرنا أن نقدم لكم سورة يس مكتوبة كاملة بالرسم العثماني برواية حفص عن عاصم بصيغة  PDF للقراءة على الجوال والكمبيوتر.</p>\n\n\n\n<script>\n\nfunction updateplayer() {\nvar sourceUrl = document.getElementById('reciter_ayates').value;\n//alert(sourceUrl);\n//var source = document​.​getElementById​(​\"mp3_src\"​)​;\n//source.src = sourceUrl;\n//document​.​getElementById​(​\"mp3ppl\"​)​.​src = sourceUrl;\ndocument.getElementById('desc').innerHTML = sourceUrl;\n\n}\n\n</script>\n<div class=\"card mt-3\">\n<h3 style = \"font-size: 21px;\" class=\"mt-20 mb-20\"><a id=\"mp3\" name=\"3\">الاستماع لسورة يس</a></h3>\n<form class=\"form\" role=\"form\"><select class=\"form-control\" id=\"reciter_ayates\" style=\"width:60%;\" onchange=\"updateplayer()\"><option value=\"https://archive.org/download/Ammar-Almulla/036.mp3\">عمار الملا علي</option><option value=\"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/ahmed_ibn_3ali_al-3ajamy/036.mp3\">احمد إبن علي العجمي</option><option value=\"https://ia803208.us.archive.org/21/items/hassan_mohaed_saleh/036.mp3\">حسن صالح</option><option value=\"https://server10.mp3quran.net/jleel/036.mp3\">خالد الجليل</option><option value=\"https://server7.mp3quran.net/shur/036.mp3\">سعود الشريم </option><option value=\"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abu_bakr_ash-shaatree/036.mp3\">ابو بكر الشاطري </option><option value=\"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/abdulbaset_mujawwad/036.mp3\">عبد الباسط مجود</option><option value=\"https://server11.mp3quran.net/sds/036.mp3\">عبد الرحمن السديس</option><option value=\"https://server6.mp3quran.net/bsfr/036.mp3\">عبد الله بصفر</option><option value=\"https://server13.mp3quran.net/jhn/036.mp3\">عبد الله الجهني</option><option value=\"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/huthayfi/036.mp3\">علي الحذيفي</option><option value=\"https://server9.mp3quran.net/omar_warsh/036.mp3\">عمر القزابري ورش</option><option value=\"https://server8.mp3quran.net/frs_a/036.mp3\">فارس عباد</option><option value=\"https://server12.mp3quran.net/maher/036.mp3\">ماهر المعيقلي</option><option value=\"https://server10.mp3quran.net/minsh/036.mp3\">محمد صديق المنشاوي</option><option value=\"https://server13.mp3quran.net/husr/036.mp3\">محمود خليل الحصري</option><option value=\"https://ia801002.us.archive.org/14/items/golmami2005_yahoo_002_20180409_1406/036.mp3\">مصطفى اسماعيل</option><option value=\"https://ia803201.us.archive.org/8/items/noreen-sedeeq/036.mp3\">نورين محمد صديق</option><option value=\"https://server8.mp3quran.net/afs/036.mp3\">مشاري العفاسي</option><option value=\"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/sa3d_al-ghaamidi/complete/036.mp3\">سعد الغامدي</option><option value=\"https://download.quranicaudio.com/quran/yasser_ad-dussary/036.mp3\">ياسر الدوسري</option></select></form>\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n<audio id=\"player\" controls=\"controls\">\n  <source id=\"mp3ppl\" src=\"https://archive.org/download/Ammar-Almulla/036.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">\nYour browser does not support the audio element.\n</audio>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n     <br />\n<script>\n  function updateplayer() {\n    // 1. الحصول على رابط القارئ المختار\n    var newSourceUrl = document.getElementById('reciter_ayates').value;\n\n    // 2. الحصول على عنصر المصدر داخل المشغل (الذي يحمل الـ ID = mp3ppl)\n    var sourceElement = document.getElementById('mp3ppl');\n\n    // 3. تحديث خاصية src لهذا العنصر بالرابط الجديد\n    sourceElement.src = newSourceUrl;\n\n    // 4. الحصول على عنصر المشغل نفسه (الذي يحمل الـ ID = player)\n    var player = document.getElementById('player');\n\n    // 5. أمر المشغل بإعادة تحميل الملف الصوتي الجديد\n    player.load();\n\n    // 6. (اختياري) يمكنك إلغاء التعليق عن السطر التالي ليبدأ التشغيل تلقائياً\n    // player.play();\n  }\n</script>\n\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">للقراءة اضغط هنا<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"wp-image-6776\" style=\"width: 150px;\" src=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Down-arrow-icon.png\" alt=\"Down arrow icon\" srcset=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Down-arrow-icon.png 500w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Down-arrow-icon-300x300.png 300w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Down-arrow-icon-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></h3>\n\n\n<style>.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e\"]{font-style:normal;font-family:\"Arial Black\", Gadget, sans-serif;text-shadow:3px 3px 3px rgba(12,238,67,0.2);}.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e mark.kt-highlight, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e\"] mark.kt-highlight{font-style:normal;color:#f76a0c;-webkit-box-decoration-break:clone;box-decoration-break:clone;padding-top:0px;padding-right:0px;padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:0px;}.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e img.kb-inline-image, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e\"] img.kb-inline-image{width:150px;vertical-align:baseline;}@media all and (max-width: 1024px){.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e\"]{text-shadow:3px 3px 3px rgba(12,238,67,0.2);}}@media all and (max-width: 767px){.wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e, .wp-block-kadence-advancedheading.kt-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e[data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e\"]{text-shadow:3px 3px 3px rgba(12,238,67,0.2);}}</style>\n<h4 class=\"kt-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e wp-block-kadence-advancedheading\" data-kb-block=\"kb-adv-heading7184_70145b-4e\"><a href=\"https://quranbook.org/%d8%b3%d9%88%d8%b1%d8%a9-%d9%8a%d8%a7%d8%b3%d9%8a%d9%86-%d9%85%d9%83%d8%aa%d9%88%d8%a8%d8%a9-%d9%83%d8%a7%d9%85%d9%84%d8%a9/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">سورة ياسين مكتوبة كاملة بالتشكيل</a></h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">تنزيل سورة يس مكتوبة كاملة بالرسم العثماني برواية حفص عن عاصم بصيغة PDF، تحميل ملف PDF بخط كبير جدًا وبجودة عالية وبرابط واحد مباشر.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>تنزيل سورة يس PDF كاملة بخط المصحف حفص:</strong></p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full is-resized\"><a href=\"https://surahquran.com/surah-pdf/pdf/036.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" src=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-5735\" style=\"width:90px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1-1.png 256w, https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/PDF1-1-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 256px) 100vw, 256px\" /></a></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:56px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-pdfemb-pdf-embedder-viewer\"><a href=\"https://quranbook.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/036.pdf\" class=\"pdfemb-viewer\" style=\"\" data-width=\"max\" data-height=\"max\" data-toolbar=\"bottom\" data-toolbar-fixed=\"off\">036</a></div>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://surahquran.com/36.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">سوره ياسين مكتوبة كاملة بالتشكيل من المصحف</a></h3>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><a href=\"https://quranbook.org/%d9%85%d8%aa%d8%b9%d8%a8-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%ad%d8%b1%d8%a8%d9%8a-%d8%b3%d9%88%d8%b1%d8%a9-%d9%8a%d8%b3-%d8%b4%d8%a7%d8%b1%d9%83%d9%86%d8%a7-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%a7%d8%ac%d8%b1/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">متعب الحربي | سورة يس | شاركنا الاجر</a></h2>\n",
